<statement>
<p>
A system of equations was written as an augmented matrix, which was row reduced to:</p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{\left[\begin{array}{cccc} {1}\amp{0}\amp{0}\amp{2}\\{0}\amp{1}\amp{0}\amp{4}\\{0}\amp{0}\amp{1}\amp-{1}\end{array}\right]}</m></p>
<p>
What is the solution to the original system of equations?</p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{x}</m> = <fillin characters="20"/></p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{y}</m> = <fillin characters="20"/></p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{z}</m> = <fillin characters="20"/>
</p>
</statement>
<answer>
<p><ul><li>2</li><li>4</li><li>-1</li></ul></p>
</answer>

